#. module: eh_account_consolidation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_consolidation.field_eh_consol_run_line__account_code
msgid ""
"Snapshot of the account code at run time. account.account.code is a non-"
"stored, company-dependent compute in Odoo 19, so it is captured here as a "
"plain stored value for a reproducible run."
msgstr ""
"執行時科目代碼的快照。在 Odoo 19 中，account.account.code "
"是一個非儲存、依公司而定的計算欄位，因此在此處將其擷取為普通儲存值，以實現可重現的執行。"

#. module: eh_account_consolidation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_consolidation.field_eh_consol_run_line__account_name
msgid ""
"Snapshot of the account name at run time. Stored as a plain label so the "
"consolidation run stays reproducible regardless of the active language."
msgstr "執行時科目名稱的快照。以普通標籤形式儲存，使合併執行無論目前語言為何皆可重現。"

#. module: eh_account_consolidation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_consolidation.field_eh_consol_entity__active
msgid ""
"Soft-archive flag. Inactive entities are hidden from the run-creation picker"
" but existing runs stay readable."
msgstr "軟封存標記。停用的實體會從執行建立選擇器中隱藏，但現有執行仍可讀取。"

#. module: eh_account_consolidation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_consolidation.field_eh_consol_run_line__company_id
msgid "Source company. Empty for CTA + multi-source rows."
msgstr "來源公司。CTA 和多來源列為空。"

#. module: eh_account_consolidation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_consolidation.field_eh_consol_run_line__elimination_id
msgid "Source elimination, when the row originates from one."
msgstr "來源沖銷，當該列源自某項沖銷時。"

#. module: eh_account_consolidation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_consolidation.field_eh_consol_run_line__member_id
msgid "Source member, when the row originates from a subsidiary."
msgstr "來源成員，當該列源自子公司時。"

#. module: eh_account_consolidation
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:eh_account_consolidation.field_eh_consol_entity__code
msgid ""
"Stable programmatic identifier (alphanumeric + underscore). Used for cross-"
"record references so a renamed name does not break external links."
msgstr "穩定的程式化識別碼（字母數字 + 底線）。用於跨記錄引用，因此重新命名名稱不會破壞外部連結。"

